{"seq":30,"slug":"api-design-rest-graphql","title":"API 设计与演进","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# API 设计与演进\n\n一个 API 的寿命往往比设计它的团队还长。今天写下的一个 URL 路径、一个字段名、一个状态码，明天就会被几十个客户端硬编码进去，三年后想改都改不动。正因如此，API 设计不是「把函数暴露出去」这么简单，而是一门关于「契约」的工程：你向外许下一个稳定的承诺，然后要在不断变化的业务需求下，让这个承诺既能被信赖、又能被演进。\n\n这个 hub 把 API 的设计与演进拆成四章，沿着「先打地基、再盖主楼、再看不同建筑流派、最后管理整栋楼的生命周期」的顺序层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」回答最底层的问题：世界上有哪些 API 范式（REST、GraphQL、RPC、gRPC、事件驱动），它们各自把「调用」建模成什么；如何把业务领域映射成可被引用的资源与稳定的契约；以及 HTTP 这套被所有 Web API 共用的语义底座——方法、幂等性、缓存、状态码——到底规定了什么。没有这一章，后面的所有讨论都会悬空。\n\n第二章「REST 设计」把第一章的 HTTP 语义落地成最主流的设计风格。它讲 REST 的六条约束与 Richardson 成熟度模型、HATEOAS 为什么常被简化；讲集合资源绕不开的分页、过滤与排序该用哪种模式；讲错误该如何用 RFC 9457 的 problem details 标准化表达，而不是每个团队各发明一套 JSON。\n\n第三章「GraphQL 与 RPC」跳出 REST，看另外两大流派。GraphQL 用一张强类型 schema 让客户端自己描述要什么；gRPC 用 Protobuf 和 HTTP/2 把跨服务调用压到极致性能。最后一篇把三种范式放在同一张桌子上对比，给出在什么场景该选谁的判断框架。\n\n第四章「生命周期」处理 API 上线之后的事：如何做版本管理与兼容性演进、如何用 OAuth 2.1 与 OIDC 做认证授权并守住安全底线、如何用文档、治理流程与契约测试让一个 API 在多团队协作下不腐坏。\n\n四章之间不是平行的并列，而是一条依赖链：基础定义词汇，REST 与 GraphQL/RPC 是基于这套词汇的两种主要落地路线，生命周期则是无论选哪条路线都要面对的长期工程。建议按顺序阅读，但每篇都自带交叉链接，方便随时跳转回需要的概念。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-paradigms","title":"API 范式与风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/foundations/api-paradigms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-modeling","title":"资源建模与契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/foundations/resource-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"http-semantics","title":"HTTP 语义与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/foundations/http-semantics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rest-design","title":"REST 设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/rest-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"restful-principles","title":"RESTful 原则与 HATEOAS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/rest-design/restful-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pagination-filtering","title":"分页、过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/rest-design/pagination-filtering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"error-handling-status","title":"错误处理与状态设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/rest-design/error-handling-status"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"graphql-rpc","title":"GraphQL 与 RPC","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/graphql-rpc","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graphql-schema","title":"GraphQL 模式与查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/graphql-rpc/graphql-schema"},{"seq":2,"slug":"grpc-protobuf","title":"gRPC 与 Protobuf","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/graphql-rpc/grpc-protobuf"},{"seq":3,"slug":"choosing-paradigm","title":"范式选型与对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/graphql-rpc/choosing-paradigm"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"lifecycle","title":"生命周期","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/lifecycle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-evolution","title":"版本管理与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/lifecycle/versioning-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"auth-security","title":"认证、授权与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/lifecycle/auth-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"docs-governance","title":"文档、治理与契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/api-design-rest-graphql/lifecycle/docs-governance"}]}]}